WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:02.605
Pen names

2
00:00:03.112 --> 00:00:08.726
Publish under as many names as you like. Each one gets its own bio, photo and link.

3
00:00:08.728 --> 00:00:16.585
Paste your pen names here, one per line.

4
00:00:16.588 --> 00:00:28.647
Each name now has a card. Add a short bio and a website, then Save.

5
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:35.254
When you start a book, pick the pen name it goes out under. Your own name never has to appear.
